{
  "layout": "oz_vpp_pane_spawns",
  "note": "Ядро › Точки появи (VPP rework 2026-11-12, design §5.1; artboard CoreSpawns): the service's switch in the head; every point on the left, grouped -- the staging zone, the faction zones (the fallback among them), the personal points; in the middle a scheme of the points around the admin (no map: circles are the zones, the square is you, north is up), drawn on a CanvasWidget by the script; on the right the faction zone form (for whom, radius, place here, remove) and the personal point form. Removing and the switch ask on the window's confirm strip. Created by OZ_VppMenu.OnCreate; the shell moves it into the content area. Laid out at the content size of the default window (1060 x 680); a smaller window cuts it at the edge. Names BtnSpOn, SpawnList, SpScheme, SpSchemeScale, SpSchemePick, BtnSpFac, SpSlug, SpRadius, BtnSpHere, BtnSpClear, SpUid, BtnSpUidHere and BtnSpUidClear are read by OZ_VppMenu.c.",
  "root": {
    "frame": {
      "name": "PaneSpawns",
      "size": "$vpp.content",
      "at": [0, "$vpp.paneY"],
      "hidden": true,
      "priority": 2,
      "note": "Hidden: ShowPane shows the open page and hides the rest.",
      "children": [
        {
          "vbox": {
            "name": "SpBody",
            "size": "fill",
            "children": [
              {
                "frame": {
                  "name": "SpHead",
                  "h": 60,
                  "children": [
                    {"label": {"name": "SpTitle", "at": [24, 9], "size": [520, 26], "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_TITLE", "font": "title", "color": "$vppText"}},
                    {"label": {"name": "SpSub", "at": [24, 35], "size": [700, 18], "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_SUB", "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted"}},
                    {"button": {"name": "BtnSpOn", "anchor": "right", "at": [24, 15], "size": [270, 30], "text": "", "font": "small", "bg": "$vppRaised", "edge": "$vppEdge", "color": "$vppText", "note": "The service's switch: the script writes the state into BtnSpOnText and asks on the confirm strip before it flips."}},
                    {"panel": {"name": "SpHeadRule", "at": [0, 59], "size": [1060, 1], "color": "$vppEdge"}}
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "hbox": {
                  "name": "SpCols",
                  "h": "fill",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "panel": {
                        "name": "SpLeft",
                        "w": 330,
                        "color": "$vppPanel",
                        "inset": 16,
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "vbox": {
                              "name": "SpLeftCol",
                              "size": "fill",
                              "gap": 8,
                              "children": [
                                {"label": {"name": "SpListTag", "h": 18, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_ALL", "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted"}},
                                {"listbox": {"name": "SpawnList", "h": "fill", "font": "field", "color": "$vppText", "props": {"style": "NoScrollBar", "title visible": false, "highlight row": true, "lines": 19, "colums": "who;42;where;44;r;14;"}, "note": "The points by group: a caption row per group, then its points (who, where, radius); the picked one in the accent colour."}},
                                {"text": {"name": "SpListNote", "h": 34, "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted", "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_LIST_NOTE"}}
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {"panel": {"name": "SpRuleA", "w": 1, "color": "$vppEdge"}},
                    {
                      "panel": {
                        "name": "SpMid",
                        "w": 370,
                        "color": "$vppPanel",
                        "inset": 16,
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "vbox": {
                              "name": "SpMidCol",
                              "size": "fill",
                              "gap": 8,
                              "children": [
                                {"text": {"name": "SpSchemeTag", "h": 34, "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted", "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_SCHEME_TAG"}},
                                {
                                  "panel": {
                                    "name": "SpSchemeBox",
                                    "h": "fill",
                                    "color": "$vppCell",
                                    "children": [
                                      {"raw": {"name": "SpScheme", "class": "CanvasWidgetClass", "size": "fill", "props": {"ignorepointer": 1}, "note": "Drawn by OZ_VppMenu.SpDrawScheme: range rings, the points as circles, the admin as a square in the middle."}}
                                    ]
                                  }
                                },
                                {"label": {"name": "SpSchemeScale", "h": 20, "text": "", "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted"}},
                                {"text": {"name": "SpSchemePick", "h": 54, "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "small", "color": "$vppText", "text": ""}}
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {"panel": {"name": "SpRuleB", "w": 1, "color": "$vppEdge"}},
                    {
                      "panel": {
                        "name": "SpRight",
                        "w": "fill",
                        "color": "$vppHead",
                        "inset": 16,
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "vbox": {
                              "name": "SpForm",
                              "size": "fill",
                              "gap": 8,
                              "children": [
                                {"label": {"name": "SpZoneHead", "h": 24, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_ZONE_HEAD", "font": "header", "color": "$vppText"}},
                                {"label": {"name": "SpForLbl", "h": 18, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_FOR", "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted"}},
                                {"button": {"name": "BtnSpFac", "text": "", "font": "small", "bg": "$vppCell", "edge": "$vppEdge", "color": "$vppText", "note": "Cycles the zone's owner: the faction ids the server's source of factions knows, then the staging zone and the fallback."}},
                                {
                                  "hbox": {
                                    "name": "SpSlugRow",
                                    "h": 28,
                                    "gap": 8,
                                    "children": [
                                      {"label": {"name": "SpSlugLbl", "w": 120, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_SLUG", "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted"}},
                                      {"field": {"name": "SpSlug", "w": "fill", "color": "$vppText", "note": "A slug typed here wins over the cycler: one this build has not heard of, * for staging, - for the fallback."}}
                                    ]
                                  }
                                },
                                {
                                  "hbox": {
                                    "name": "SpRadRow",
                                    "h": 28,
                                    "gap": 8,
                                    "children": [
                                      {"label": {"name": "SpRadLbl", "w": 120, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_RADIUS", "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted"}},
                                      {"field": {"name": "SpRadius", "w": "fill", "color": "$vppText"}}
                                    ]
                                  }
                                },
                                {
                                  "hbox": {
                                    "name": "SpZoneBtns",
                                    "h": 32,
                                    "gap": 8,
                                    "children": [
                                      {"button": {"name": "BtnSpHere", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_HERE", "font": "small", "bg": "$vppAccent", "edge": "$vppAccent", "color": "$vppText"}},
                                      {"button": {"name": "BtnSpClear", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_CLEAR", "font": "small", "bg": "$vppHead", "edge": "$vppBad", "color": "$vppBad"}}
                                    ]
                                  }
                                },
                                {"text": {"name": "SpZoneNote", "h": 34, "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted", "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_ZONE_NOTE"}},
                                {"panel": {"name": "SpFormRule", "h": 1, "color": "$vppEdge"}},
                                {"label": {"name": "SpPersHead", "h": 24, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_PERS_HEAD", "font": "header", "color": "$vppText"}},
                                {"label": {"name": "SpUidLbl", "h": 18, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_PERS_WHO", "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted"}},
                                {"field": {"name": "SpUid", "color": "$vppText"}},
                                {
                                  "hbox": {
                                    "name": "SpPersBtns",
                                    "h": 32,
                                    "gap": 8,
                                    "children": [
                                      {"button": {"name": "BtnSpUidHere", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_PERS_HERE", "font": "small", "bg": "$vppRaised", "edge": "$vppEdge", "color": "$vppText"}},
                                      {"button": {"name": "BtnSpUidClear", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_PERS_CLEAR", "font": "small", "bg": "$vppHead", "edge": "$vppBad", "color": "$vppBad"}}
                                    ]
                                  }
                                },
                                {"text": {"name": "SpPersNote", "h": 34, "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted", "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_SP_PERS_NOTE"}}
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
